UgzN1OcgJwwmbblA2XF4AaABAg,,False,@warpthumr47,"If only everyone in the world would model themselves after the example that BTS shows us all over and over again.  I haven't really been aware of BTS for all that long (about 2 years I think) and I'm a 57 year old RN with four grown sons but they help lighten my spirit.  Yes they are phenomenally talented and their music is amazing (even though I don't speak Korean--I'm learning, lol), I think it is actually their characters and personality that really shine and why so many millions of people love them.  They are around the same ages as my sons, so for me it's like having 7 more sons to be very proud of.  Watching videos of how they've grown and endured and blossomed is a life lesson to us all.  It's like watching a lesson in how to become self-actualized.  Thank you boys and I hope you continue to inspire people to learn to love themselves as they are which leads to them loving and accepting others just as they are.  We are all one race--the human race.",4,2021-05-22T22:02:15Z,2021-05-22T22:03:11Z
