UgyunNV2aJB_IFxbK4B4AaABAg,,False,@jana.63077,"Don't know if they'll read this, but I really wanted to leave a comment for them because this is I think the only way I can connect with them and actually talk to them, I'm not really able to go to their concerts or fansigns cause I'm an international fan.



Dear BTS,
Your ARMY will always be by your side, whether you're happy or sad, and whenever you're struggling or feeling down, we'll always have your back, and that's because we love you, stan you, and appreciate everything you do. Namjoon, you're literally the best president, father, and rapper in this world. You have the most caring heart, and very high intelligence that always impresses me. Jin, your vocals are so amazing and on point. You've never let any of your ARMY down. We'll always keep on supporting our world wide handsome, it's a promise that we'll never ever break. J-hope, we truly stan you, your incredible rapping skills, your sweet heart and your positive energy that brings us hope.
Jimin, you have the most magnificent dancing and singing skills. Your performances on stage are the greatest. Don't ever say that you've messed up. You literally never did. Suga, the cutest everrr. I love you so much and really like your personality. Whatever happens, I want you to keep on going!! ARMYs have your back. Tae, your ARMYs love you and miss you so much. Your vocals, visuals, talent, it's all just amazing!! Jungkookie, the cutest baby everrrrrrr!! We love you to infinity and beyond. Keep up the great work and never listen to any of the haters out there. They're just jealous of how talented and beautiful you are. 

I really don't want it to seem like I preferred one member more than the other in this comment. If it did, then i really didn't mean to. I just wanted to give a quick positive message to each member to at least put a smile on their faces. BTS, I want you to know that we love you all so much. You amaze me in so many ways and I truly appreciate you and support you with all my heart. I love all seven of you and wish you all the best!! I purple Joon, Jin, Suga, V, Jungkook, J-hope and Jimin forever and ever!!!!!!!",1,2020-09-02T22:45:56Z,2020-09-02T22:45:56Z
