UgyJXM8b49Gh0z2nzVB4AaABAg,,False,@ot7839,"Don't mistake the emotionally charged scene between V and Jin at 7:23 as homoerotic, maybe a little flirtatious though - there is a background story to it: this moment in the choreography was precisely the reason V and Jin had an argument three years earlier when during their Wings tour in NY,  Taehyung asked Jin to move a little bit faster on stage when singing that part, and Jin felt dissed as the older hyung but inferior dancer.  Whole group discussion and tears ensued and their relationship was strained for some time.  V's loving gesture and Jin's coy smile (and RM's hand gesture earlier) allude to their memory and homage to that - their ""coming of age"" period.  A befitting salute at a graduation celebration, in my mind.",194,2020-08-13T20:54:06Z,2020-08-17T20:24:19Z
