UgxsHTrdzC2cSwQ5B4x4AaABAg,,False,@nazlihendou6612,I remember myself in 2014 and how depressed I was. I was also about to graduate from high school and I was so confused about life. Then I also remember little BTS who were the new kids and who a lot of people looked down on them. They cheered me up so much with their goofiness and natural charm. I became attached in a second. Back then no one knew about Kpop. They were my secret source of happiness. We were both living in a different world. But we both had something in common. YOUTH and DETERMINATION. Being in the same group age as them I just related to the lyrics of their song. I'm so proud of BTS and I'm so proud of myself. Seven years that's a long way! I know things might be crazy lately for some of you Army. I would really love to quote one song for you: '' When the minute and second hands overlap. The world holds its breath for a little while''. I hope you will take a moment to breathe and remember that everything is temporary. I wish for Army to find yourself within time and experience. I hope you'll find happiness in this fandom and that it will give you the strength to find happiness within yourself. I don't know if it's me turning 23 next week or Bangtan turning seven or this graduation thing hahaha but if this message makes only one person happy then I'm happy!,56,2020-06-15T03:17:19Z,2020-06-15T03:17:19Z
