UgxMN1ZdJrjmgXZSPEl4AaABAg,,False,@handekiranta,Going 12/13 years to school. Only to have a wonderful graduation to say goodbye to our favorite teachers and friends. To the memories we made during the school time. Laughed. Cried. Felt in love. Made new friends. Yes.. 12/13 years went by so fast. But the virus ended everything we were planing on doing in our senior year.. you can’t lie we all couldn’t study that well nor could our teachers help us via Videochat and so on.. nobody didn’t really feel our pain on not having a graduation. But BTS know how we feel and did THIS for US!! They gave us the feeling “you made it and we are proud of you”. It feels like we graduated with them. They gave us a small graduation gift. I know all of this sounds sooooo cringy but I’m sad as well. We may not have a graduation but we could say we were the Virus class 2020! BTS loves us all and wants us to be happy! Stay safe and keep your head up! ❤️🧡💛💚💙💜🖤🤍,11,2020-06-08T23:36:57Z,2020-06-08T23:36:57Z
