UgwnCmpS5LEe4GNVidR4AaABAg,,False,@talaroro1997,"Lately, I’ve been drifting away from the things I love and make me happy like bts because I was feeling like SUCH a failure. I had 6 job interviews in 4 days (lockdown ended where I live), and I got no call backs. Along with the pressure of being a graduate was slowly creeping in. All I could think about for the last week if not even longer was how much I hate myself and how I was a failure, I really really hated myself. But then their speeches happen along with this performance, and I swear as soon as I remembered that these men are here to comfort me in the craziest year of my life, they are here to hold me through their songs, I immediately cried for almost 2 hours.
I am so proud of what they become and no one has any idea how much I wish if I could make them as happy as they made me.
Thank you so much BTS. You keep changing my life 💜",8,2020-06-08T23:35:28Z,2020-06-08T23:35:28Z
