Ugz0e7JTtC0C0nqkuj54AaABAg,,False,@Riachan93,"I just realized it's been exactly one year since the BTS concert in Paris I went to. I will never, ever forget that day. Mikrokosmos was the very last song, the one where they said their goodbyes to us. I clearly remember Jimin shouting ""I am so happy!!!"" at the top of his lungs, waving with the biggest Jiminie smile. Everybody sang along, the night was just beginning to fall so all the army bombs were lit up, creating this vast ocean of lights. It really felt like every one of us was their own little galaxy at that moment. It was one of the most magical weekends of my life. Ever since then I'm convinced that a BTS concert is the happiest place on earth. 
I never would have thought that one year later, the world would have come to this. I can tell BTS miss us just as much as we miss them. You can see it in their faces and hear it in their voices when they speak. There is a reason they chose Spring Day to perform for this event. That song is a promise that after the long winter, flowers will bloom and we will meet each other again.",77,2020-06-08T15:48:43Z,2020-06-08T15:48:43Z
